BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:asru-2025-conference@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251206
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20251211
SUMMARY:ASRU 2025 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:IEEE Automatic Speech Recognition and Understanding Workshop\nS
 tatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://2025.ieee
 asru.org/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#asru-2025\
 nNotes: Official site gives Honolulu (Hyatt Regency Waikiki)\, Dec 6-10\,
  2025\; biennial flagship IEEE SPS SLTC workshop\, all papers as posters.
  Regular and special-session papers (6 + 2 pages\, double-blind) were due
  May 28\, with a June 4 revision for submitted papers\; demo/system/data 
 and challenge papers (3 + 1 pages) were due June 25. Both tracks are in I
 EEE Xplore. No cutoff hour was published\; AoE is provisional. Stale auth
 or-instruction pages list an Aug 13 camera-ready\; the dates page and hom
 e page say Aug 20. SPS reports 447 submissions\, 212 accepted and 385 reg
 istrants. From 2027 IEEE ASLI builds on ASRU and SLT\, so no ASRU 2027 is
  projected. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Signal Processing,Natural Language Processing & LLMs,Machine Lea
 rning,Deep Representation Learning
URL:https://2025.ieeeasru.org/
LOCATION:Honolulu\, Hawaii\, USA
END:VEVENT
