UID:slt-2026-conference@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261213
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261217
SUMMARY:SLT 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:IEEE Spoken Language Technology Workshop\nStatus: confirmed\, c
 hecked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://attend.ieee.org/slt-2026/\nVe
 nue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#slt-2026\nNotes: Organi
 zer and SPS pages confirm Dec 13-16\, 2026 at Hotel Saracen Sands\, Isola
  delle Femmine\, 15 km from Palermo\; accepted papers must be presented i
 n person. Deadlines are 23:59 AoE. Regular and special-session papers (6 
 + 2 pages\, double-blind) moved from Jun 17 to Jun 24\; OpenReview calls 
 Jun 24 abstract registration and Jul 1 the full submission. Demo/system/d
 ata and challenge papers (3 + 1 pages) are also in IEEE Xplore. The SPS j
 ournal-paper date has no call text and is schedule-only. SPS reports abou
 t 750 submissions\; the program lists 323 papers. SPS calls this the fina
 l standalone SLT before its new ASLI conference (2027)\, so no SLT 2028 i
 s projected. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Natural Language Processing & LLMs,Signal Processing,Deep Repres
 entation Learning
URL:https://attend.ieee.org/slt-2026/
LOCATION:Palermo\, Italy
END:VEVENT
